{"3036360": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Heaven Crawler", "steam_appid": 3036360, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore, fight and unveil the secrets of a mysterious tower using unique mechanical arms to crawl your way through a personal journey.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3036360/extras/12c2d73c87d3417c46803acc5e9eead5.poster.avif?t=1781465706\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3036360/extras/12c2d73c87d3417c46803acc5e9eead5.webm?t=1781465706\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3036360/extras/12c2d73c87d3417c46803acc5e9eead5.mp4?t=1781465706\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Make your way through rooms full of automatas to ascend the tower</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The tower, riddled with mystery and secrets, is layered in Biomes. Each with unique rooms, traps, challenges and enemies to defeat. Gain souls, level up, get better equipment and improve each run! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3036360/extras/21826c2ca94b623b935ff67684d155d0.poster.avif?t=1781465706\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3036360/extras/21826c2ca94b623b935ff67684d155d0.webm?t=1781465706\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3036360/extras/21826c2ca94b623b935ff67684d155d0.mp4?t=1781465706\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Mix-and-match Gear, Magic, Skills and Relics to build your own playstyle!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are no classes in the game, instead each item unlocks diferent stats and abilities for you to choose and make your own! They can also be upgraded!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3036360/extras/7f74002527d982589c2c3587bd6ef9c6.poster.avif?t=1781465706\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3036360/extras/7f74002527d982589c2c3587bd6ef9c6.webm?t=1781465706\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3036360/extras/7f74002527d982589c2c3587bd6ef9c6.mp4?t=1781465706\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Be wary and use the Elements to your favor in order to master each Zone!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fully reactive elements, like electricty, fire, ice and corrosion that unlocks new gameplay &amp; combat possibilities as well as environmental interactions. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3036360/extras/c58e9efaa4f28c441ea9eb3e6e4ccba8.poster.avif?t=1781465706\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3036360/extras/c58e9efaa4f28c441ea9eb3e6e4ccba8.webm?t=1781465706\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3036360/extras/c58e9efaa4f28c441ea9eb3e6e4ccba8.mp4?t=1781465706\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Interact with the world to uncover the secrets of The Womb and the world left behind.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can aid NPC's by setting them free, rescuing or defeating them on your way up. They will help you in your journey with their unique systems, shops and more!  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3036360/extras/bce4b70424077901f0951e1d925efddc.poster.avif?t=1781465706\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3036360/extras/bce4b70424077901f0951e1d925efddc.webm?t=1781465706\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3036360/extras/bce4b70424077901f0951e1d925efddc.mp4?t=1781465706\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Buy, Upgrade &amp; Expand your Equipment</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Piece together the Tower’s true purpose and unravel the mystery that binds it all together. Use every bit of knowledge at your advantage and unlock your true potential.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3036360/extras/5b24c2b7bbf746981cc243a8e86920ef.poster.avif?t=1781465706\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3036360/extras/5b24c2b7bbf746981cc243a8e86920ef.webm?t=1781465706\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3036360/extras/5b24c2b7bbf746981cc243a8e86920ef.mp4?t=1781465706\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >At every Layer of the Tower, a Colossal Mechanical Creatrures awaits your mastery!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Challenge the guardians that keep the tower and make your way through in order to achieve your ultimate goal.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3036360/extras/981e2a01a3bdc4a073188ee4e85b668b.poster.avif?t=1781465706\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3036360/extras/981e2a01a3bdc4a073188ee4e85b668b.webm?t=1781465706\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3036360/extras/981e2a01a3bdc4a073188ee4e85b668b.mp4?t=1781465706\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Each defeat is an opportunity to learn and grow!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Everytime you die, you go back to lobby with some of your souls and losing all your Satchel, but gain Research and Profficency on the equipment you used, as well as new adquired information, improving your chances for your next run. Expand and Improve your Lobby, and with it, your odds at success.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3036360/extras/8abc520d82a961e78a99753c6f1d7980.poster.avif?t=1781465706\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3036360/extras/8abc520d82a961e78a99753c6f1d7980.webm?t=1781465706\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3036360/extras/8abc520d82a961e78a99753c6f1d7980.mp4?t=1781465706\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Heavy early-2000's atmosphere and vibes-filled visual style!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Indulge yourself with a fresh look within the genre, designed to enhance a journey of colossal proportions. <br>Inspired by The Ledend of Zelda, NieR series and Fumito Ueda's work!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3036360/extras/6733045bc7bc1bf8e61d425d7c72887d.poster.avif?t=1781465706\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3036360/extras/6733045bc7bc1bf8e61d425d7c72887d.webm?t=1781465706\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3036360/extras/6733045bc7bc1bf8e61d425d7c72887d.mp4?t=1781465706\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The Full Game will Feature:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >6 Elemental Modifiers </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >9 Zones with unique Hazards</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >10+ Unlockable NPC’s to interact with </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > 10+ Multi-phase Bosses</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >30+ Enemies with unique Behaviour</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >100+ Gear and Items to Mix-n-Match </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Endless Rooms &amp; Possibilities </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Beautiful Orchestral Soundtrack</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >WISHLIST NOW &amp; FOLLOW US ON KICKSTARTER</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3036360/extras/fcb4d2081c084f7b58b07303672778ad.poster.avif?t=1781465706\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3036360/extras/fcb4d2081c084f7b58b07303672778ad.webm?t=1781465706\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3036360/extras/fcb4d2081c084f7b58b07303672778ad.mp4?t=1781465706\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><h2 c